Your pet is currently a panther, right? She'll probably eat
freshly-killed corpses. Non-domestic pets (anything except cats, dogs
and horses) that normally eat (liches, for instance, don't) will not
eat people food, or even pet food, unless they're very hungry. There's
no need to throw anything, she'll get tamer every time she eats.
 
